msgid "Variables and Contexts"
msgstr "变量和上下文"

#: ../../source/architecture/expression.md:157 54538db18a82492dbd0a67e3725860f0
msgid ""
"Variables can be used in expressions. In order to compile an expression "
"containing variables, A `CompileContext` must be provided to define the "
"types of variables. A [JSON Schema](http://json-schema.org/) definition can "
"be used as a source of `CompileContext`. For example (in YAML format for "
"simplicity, but you can surely use JSON format)"
msgstr ""
"变量可在表达式中使用。为了编译包含变量的表达式，必须提供一个 "
"`CompileContext` 来定义变量的类型。JSON Schema](http://json-schema.org/)定义"
"可用作 “编译上下文 ”的来源。例如（为简单起见使用 YAML 格式，但也可以使用 "
"JSON 格式）"

#: ../../source/architecture/expression.md:175 0905049240f74296b37a66365d2cf20c
msgid ""
"where variables `a`, `b`, `c`, `d` are defined with specified types. "
"According to the schema, you can provide a data source as (in YAML format)"
msgstr ""
"其中变量 `a`、`b`、`c`、`d` 是以指定类型定义的。根据模式，您可以提供以下数据"
"源（YAML 格式）"

#: ../../source/architecture/expression.md:182 e4ceea7ccaf344e4b78f5c0ae854bc47
msgid "Then an `RtExpr` can be compiled and evaluated as following"
msgstr "那么，一个 `RtExpr` 的编译和评估过程如下"

#: ../../source/architecture/expression.md:200 6dba6d0416cc4044a079d33e10b12468
msgid "Nested Context"
msgstr "嵌套上下文"

#: ../../source/architecture/expression.md:202 4ceb7c888b184cd38323d7403ee09303
msgid ""
"In a JSON Schema definition, objects and arrays can be nested into each "
"other, for example"
msgstr "在 JSON 模式定义中，对象和数组可以相互嵌套，例如"

#: ../../source/architecture/expression.md:224 976409592969448ab84cc9adfc935a85
msgid ""
"For JSON Schema of type `array`, if its `additionalItems` is set to `true`, "
"the number and types of its elements are determined, so each of its elements "
"will be compiled to a standalone variable. This also happens to JSON Schema "
"of type `object` with a non-null `properties`, if its `properties` is not "
"null and `additionalProperties` is set to `false` , each of its properties "
"will be compiled to a standalone variable. Otherwise, an `array` is compiled "
"to `LIST` and a `map` to `MAP`."
msgstr ""
"对于 `array` 类型的 JSON Schema，如果其 `additionalItems` 设置为 `true`，其元"
"素的数量和类型将被确定，因此其每个元素将被编译为一个独立变量。如果 JSON "
"Schema 的 `properties` 不为空，且 `additionalProperties` 设置为 `false`，那么"
"它的每个属性都将被编译为一个独立变量。否则，\"数组 \"将被编译为 \"LIST\"，"
"\"映射 \"将被编译为 \"MAP\"。"

#: ../../source/architecture/expression.md:230 d881674e1f404787b8ca6a13d40c05b8
msgid ""
"If an `object` type does not have `properties` defined, it is compiled to "
"`OBJECT`."
msgstr ""
"如果一个 `object` 类型没有定义 `properties` 属性，它将被编译为 `OBJECT` 类"
"型。"

#: ../../source/architecture/expression.md:232 ee4aa66836014f23aaa09afab734af6c
msgid ""
"As in the JSON schema above, you can use `a.b` and `a.c` to access the "
"variables of `number` and `boolean` types, separately. The syntax looks the "
"same as map index, but they are really different variables and `a` is not an "
"existing variable at all in runtime. Also, you can use `d[0]` and `d[1]` to "
"access the `integer` and the `string` variables and `d` is not an existing "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"在上面的 JSON 模式中，可以使用 `a.b` 和 `a.c` 分别访问 `number` 和 `boolean` "
"类型的变量。语法看起来与 map 索引相同，但它们实际上是不同的变量，而且 `a` 在"
"运行时根本不是一个现有变量。此外，您可以使用 `d[0]` 和 `d[1]` 访问 `integer` "
"和 `string` 变量，而 `d` 并不是一个现有变量。"

#: ../../source/architecture/expression.md:237 c266a019b437452aaed0df4cf3e30035
msgid ""
"The special variable `$` can be used to access the whole context, so `$.a` "
"is the same as `a`. `$` is useful for a context with an array as root. The "
"parser also looks on `a.b` as `a['b']`, so the syntax to access variables is "
"much like JSONPath."
msgstr ""
"特殊变量 `$` 可用来访问整个上下文，因此 `$.a` 与 `a` 相同。对于以数组为根的上"
"下文，`$` 非常有用。解析器也会将 `a.b` 视为 `a['b']`，因此访问变量的语法与 "
"JSONPath 很相似。"
